1
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:05,730
Okay,this is it.
好，該結婚了

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,070
You sure you wanna do this?
你確定要這麼做？

3
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,540
Hello,Mrs. Ross.
你好，羅斯太太

4
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:17,970
Well,hello,Mr. Rachel.
你好，瑞秋先生

5
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,950
-Whoa! -Oh,my God!
我的天哪

6
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,720
Come on,Phoebe,hurry!
菲比快點！快快快 

7
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:32,830
Okay! Okay!
好啦

8
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,660
Oh,my God! Is everybody getting married?
我的天哪！大家都要結婚嗎？

9
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:42,440
No running in the chapel.
教堂裡不准奔跑

10
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:45,570
Hey, don't you give me any of your.. Hey!
你少跟我來這…

11
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,600
Why are you here?
你們來幹什麼？

12
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:52,010
Ross and Rachel left a message. They're getting married.
羅斯和瑞秋留言說要結婚

13
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:56,510
-Isn't that why you guys are here? -Yes. Why else would we be here?
你們不是來找他們的嗎？ 當然是 不然我們來幹什麼？

15
00:00:59,590 --> 00:01:01,350
What happened? Did we miss it?
怎麼樣？我們來晚了嗎？

16
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:02,950
We missed it.
我們也沒趕上

17
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,320
Maybe you wouldn't have if you could run in the chapel!
都是因為教堂裡不能奔跑

18
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,260
I can't believe they got married.
羅斯和瑞秋居然結婚了

19
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:11,520
I know! I didn't even know they were dating.
對啊，我還不知道他們復合了

20
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:14,170
I don't think they're as much dating as they are...
與其說是復合 

21
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:17,700
...two bottles of vodka walking around in human form.
不如說是被伏特加附身

22
00:01:17,910 --> 00:01:19,130
This is insane.
真是太扯了

23
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:22,310
What's the big deal? It's not like it's a real marriage.
有什麼關係？又不是真結婚

24
00:01:22,910 --> 00:01:24,310
What?
什麼？

25
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:28,320
If you marry in Vegas, you're only married in Vegas.
在賭城結婚只有在賭城有效

26
00:01:30,650 --> 00:01:33,350
If you marry here, you're married everywhere.
你在說什麼？ 在賭城結婚到處都有效

27
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:34,750
Really?
真的？ 

28
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,410
Yeah.
是啊

29
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:39,160
Oh,my God!
天哪…

30
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:41,320
Oh,well.
啊隨便啦

31
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:45,030
The One After Vegas
本集播出：「終身大代志」

00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:47,030
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

32
00:02:56,140 --> 00:02:57,570
Why are we in bed together?
我們為什麼躺在一起？ 

33
00:02:57,810 --> 00:02:59,070
I don't know.
我不知道

34
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:03,100
-Did we? -I don't know.
我們有… 我不知道

35
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:06,850
Do you have any clothes on?
你有穿衣服嗎？ 

36
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,910
Yes.
有

37
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,180
-Really? -No.
真的？ 沒有

38
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,510
But we didn't have..
但是我們沒有…

39
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,750
...sex,did we?
嘿咻吧？

40
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:24,190
I don't remember much about last night.
我不太記得昨晚的事

41
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:27,730
It was such a blur.
一切都好模糊

42
00:03:29,370 --> 00:03:32,270
I remember laughing. I laughed a lot.
我記得我有笑，我一直笑

43
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:33,940
Then we didn't have sex.
而且我們沒怎樣

44
00:03:38,050 --> 00:03:42,110
Well,so,what did we do last night?
羅斯，我們昨晚做了什麼？

45
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:46,650
I don't know,but I think it was a lot of fun.
我不知道，但我覺得很開心

46
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:49,090
Luckily,not too much fun,right?
幸好沒有開心過頭 

47
00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:50,990
-I don't think so. -Oh,thank God.
應該沒有

48
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:57,720
Oh,I mean, we were really drunk.
我們真的醉得很慘 

49
00:03:57,930 --> 00:03:59,700
I'm glad we didn't do anything stupid.
幸好沒幹什麼蠢事

50
00:03:59,900 --> 00:04:01,030
Tell me about it.
可不是嗎

51
00:04:01,507 --> 00:04:04,005
（新婚大喜）

52
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:08,370
Morning,Phoebe.
菲比早

53
00:04:09,210 --> 00:04:12,440
Well,my movie has been officially canceled.
我的電影取消拍攝了

54
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:15,250
Joey,I'm so sorry.
好可惜喔 

55
00:04:15,450 --> 00:04:16,710
You want my breakfast?
你要不要吃我的早餐？

56
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:19,420
Too depressed to eat.
不了，我沮喪得吃不下

57
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:21,990
I'll probably eat in, like, five minutes.
過5分鐘再說吧

58
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,930
I'll fly home with you. What time is your flight?
我只好跟你們回去了 飛機是幾點？

59
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:28,720
-What about my cab? -I don't need that anymore.
我的計程車呢？ 我用不著了

60
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,460
You borrowed my cab. You have to drive it back.
你跟我借車就要開回去

61
00:04:32,670 --> 00:04:35,800
I don't wanna drive back by myself. I get lonely.
我不想自己開回去，太寂寞了

62
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:38,500
How about if you come with me?
乾脆你來陪我 

63
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:41,110
-It's a long trip. -That would be great.
我不曉得，要開很久 一定很好玩 

64
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:43,640
We could talk and play games.
我們可以聊天玩遊戲

65
00:04:43,910 --> 00:04:47,780
This could be our chance to, like, renew our friendship.
這是讓友誼變新鮮的好機會

66
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:51,310
Are you asking me to have a "frienaissance"?
你要我跟你「友誼復興」？

67
00:04:53,420 --> 00:04:54,510
Sure?
是吧？

68
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:59,690
All right. Although,I don't think we need one. I never stopped loving you.
好吧，雖然沒這個必要 我一直愛著你

69
00:05:03,530 --> 00:05:06,760
So has anybody talked to Dr. and Mrs. Geller yet?
有誰跟蓋勒博士夫婦講過話？

70
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,330
They left me a message. They'll be here.
他們有留言給我，應該快到了

71
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:12,200
Where is the waitress? I'm starving.
服務生呢？我餓死了

72
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:16,370
It's a buffet,man.
這是自助餐

73
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:20,040
Here's where I win all my money back!
我可以撈本了

74
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,950
I gotta talk to you.
我有事找你 

75
00:05:24,150 --> 00:05:25,180
Sure.
好

76
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:26,550
What's up?
什麼事？

77
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:37,320
Monica and I almost got married.
摩妮卡和我昨晚差點結婚

78
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:38,960
My God!
天哪！

79
00:05:39,170 --> 00:05:41,160
That's huge!
這可是大事

80
00:05:42,900 --> 00:05:45,400
Wait a minute. Why wasn't I invited?
等等，為什麼沒找我去？

81
00:05:46,410 --> 00:05:50,640
And who was gonna be your best man? Don't say Ross. Do not say Ross.
誰要當你的伴郎？ 不要說羅斯，不准說羅斯

82
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:55,170
I just don't think that Monica and I are ready yet. I love her...
我覺得我們還沒準備好 我很愛她 

83
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:58,910
...but seeing Ross and Rachel come out of that chapel...
但看到羅斯他們從教堂冒出來

84
00:05:59,150 --> 00:06:04,090
...was like a wake-up call that Monica and I are moving so fast, you know.
我突然驚覺我們進展得太快了

85
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:07,020
How do I tell her without crushing her?
我要怎麼講才不會讓她心碎？

86
00:06:09,730 --> 00:06:12,030
Tell her she's not marriage material.
就說她不是結婚的料

87
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:15,360
What?
什麼？

88
00:06:16,770 --> 00:06:19,040
Girls say it to me all the time.
女生都這麼對我說

89
00:06:21,180 --> 00:06:25,010
And if she's anything like me, she's just gonna be relieved.
相信我，要是她和我一樣 一定會如釋重負

90
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:29,110
How do I tell him that it's too soon?
我該怎麼說這樣太快了？

91
00:06:29,350 --> 00:06:31,750
He's gonna think I don't love him anymore.
他一定會心碎 覺得我不愛他了

92
00:06:31,950 --> 00:06:34,290
-Well,you don't. -Yes,I do.
你是不愛他了 我愛

93
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:36,420
Good. I was just testing you.
很好，我只是在測試你

94
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:39,760
-Hey. -Oh,hi.

95
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:42,090
We were just talking about bacon.
我們才剛聊到培根

96
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,560
No,we were talking about tennis.
不對，我們是在聊網球 

97
00:06:44,770 --> 00:06:47,060
Tennis is more believable.
網球比較像真的

98
00:06:52,370 --> 00:06:53,930
Thank you.

99
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:57,070
Coffee.

100
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:06,210
What?
怎樣？ 

101
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:09,410
Are we gonna talk about what you guys did last night?
你們要談談昨晚的事嗎？

102
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:15,050
What do you mean "last night"? Nothing happened last night.
昨晚什麼事？昨晚又沒怎樣

103
00:07:15,730 --> 00:07:18,390
Ross invited us all to watch.
羅斯把大家都找去看了

104
00:07:23,810 --> 00:07:26,270
What is the matter with you?
你有病啊？

105
00:07:26,810 --> 00:07:29,470
We weren't gonna miss our friends getting married.
瑞秋 我們不可能錯過朋友的婚禮

106
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,540
Who got married?
誰結婚了？

107
00:07:33,710 --> 00:07:35,150
You did.
你們啊

108
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:37,510
What?
什麼？

109
00:07:38,290 --> 00:07:41,950
-Hello. We didn't get married. -No,we didn't. That's ridi..
我們哪有結婚 怎麼可能，別鬧了

110
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:49,700
Wait,wait,wait. I remember being in a chapel.
我們…我記得去過教堂

111
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:53,360
They would not let us get married when we were that drunk.
我們醉成那樣，不可能被批准

112
00:07:53,570 --> 00:07:55,630
They let you get married.
當然可能 

113
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:58,030
Most people who marry in Vegas are drunk.
在賭城結婚的人通常都醉了

114
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:01,410
Now,I'm drunk right now.
我現在就醉了

115
00:08:03,140 --> 00:08:07,010
I can't have a mimosa with breakfast? I'm on vacation.
早餐不能喝雞尾酒啊？ 我在度假

116
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:08,850
What are you gonna do?
你們要怎麼辦？ 

117
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:11,480
Well, I guess we find a divorce lawyer.
看來得找個離婚律師了

118
00:08:11,690 --> 00:08:14,810
Well, I think.. I think Ross already has one.
我想羅斯已經有一個了

119
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:20,820
Yeah, that guy's finally gonna be able to put in that pool.
他家總算可以蓋游泳池了

120
00:08:22,230 --> 00:08:23,220
Okay.
好

121
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:27,420
Now,this one's free, right? Because you paid for the first two.
這次會免費吧？ 你辦了兩次，所以會送一次

122
00:08:28,170 --> 00:08:30,360
Laugh it up,but the joke's on you...
你笑吧，丟臉的是你

123
00:08:30,570 --> 00:08:33,060
...because we don't need to get divorced.
我們不必離婚

124
00:08:33,340 --> 00:08:36,110
-We're just gonna get an annulment. -An annulment?
只要辦理註銷 註銷？

125
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:39,540
Ross,I don't think surgery is the answer here.
羅斯，手術可幫不了你

126
00:08:42,020 --> 00:08:43,950
Oh,that's your thing!
那是你的正字標記

127
00:08:44,950 --> 00:08:46,040
What?
什麼？ 

128
00:08:47,090 --> 00:08:50,180
Your thing. You're the guy who gets divorced.
你的正字標記 你是專門離婚的人 沒錯

129
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:54,430
No,no,that's not "my thing."
那才不是我的正字標記 

130
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,260
I do not love getting divorced.
我並不愛離婚

131
00:08:57,770 --> 00:09:00,790
Yes,you do. This is your third divorce.
你當然愛，這是你第三次離婚

132
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:04,700
You love divorce so much, you're probably gonna marry it...
你愛離婚愛到搞不好會娶它

133
00:09:06,770 --> 00:09:10,400
...and then it won't work out, so you're gonna have to divorce it.
然後婚姻破裂，你又得離婚 離婚名人

134
00:09:12,210 --> 00:09:13,480
I'm so drunk.
我醉得好厲害

135
00:09:20,990 --> 00:09:24,220
-You wanna play some Pai Gow? -Maybe.
要不要玩百高？ 也行

136
00:09:24,930 --> 00:09:27,450
But I kind of think we should talk about last night.
但我有點想談談昨晚的事 

137
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:30,620
That's a good idea. I wanna talk about last night too...
好主意，我也想談

138
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:34,930
-and I don't know what Pai Gow is. -I see.
而且我不知道百高是什麼

139
00:09:35,570 --> 00:09:38,060
-So what should we do? -I don't know.
你覺得我們應該怎麼辦？ 不知道

140
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:39,970
I know I love you.
但我知道我愛你 

141
00:09:40,210 --> 00:09:41,770
I know I love you.
我也知道我愛你

142
00:09:46,810 --> 00:09:49,250
Where are we on the whole "going back...
那我們還要回過頭...

143
00:09:49,450 --> 00:09:52,440
to where they have the marriages" thing? I love you.
...去結婚嗎？ 我愛你

144
00:09:53,250 --> 00:09:54,920
That's a good question.
問得好

145
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:57,880
Last night we let the dice decide.
昨晚我們讓色子決定

146
00:09:58,090 --> 00:10:01,120
We should leave it up to fate again. I love you!
也許應該再讓命運決定一次 我愛你

147
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,960
We don't get married unless there's a sign.
沒錯，有徵兆我們才結婚

148
00:10:04,170 --> 00:10:05,790
So say...
要是...

149
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,490
you roll another eight, then there's a sign...
你又擲出八來 就表示...

150
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:09,960
that we should marry.
我們絕對應該結婚 

151
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:11,760
Eight we get married...
好，八就結婚

152
00:10:11,970 --> 00:10:16,310
but 2,3,4,5,6,7,9,10, 11,12,we don't get married.
二三四五六七九等等就不結

153
00:10:16,580 --> 00:10:17,640
Sounds great.
聽起來不錯 好

154
00:10:18,110 --> 00:10:19,740
Hey,we got a shooter.
有人要擲了

155
00:10:19,980 --> 00:10:21,110
Money,please.
請押注

156
00:10:21,350 --> 00:10:22,510
-Ready? -Ready.
好了嗎？ 好了

157
00:10:22,750 --> 00:10:24,510
Come on,eight.
來個八吧

158
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:29,620
Yes,yes,eight.
沒錯，八

159
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:33,490
Eight,easy eight.
八，三五八

160
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:40,160
-I can't believe I rolled an eight. -That was so unlikely.
居然真的是八 真是太不可能了

161
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,930
Let's get married.
那就結婚吧…

162
00:10:43,170 --> 00:10:44,800
I guess.
我猜

163
00:10:45,610 --> 00:10:48,040
Last night I rolled a hard eight.
等等，那不是雙四八 我昨晚擲的是雙四八

164
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:51,110
It was the wrong kind of eight. No wedding! Damn it!
沒錯，這個八不對 不能結婚了，可惡

165
00:10:52,650 --> 00:10:54,010
I wanted it so bad!
我好想結婚喔

166
00:10:57,490 --> 00:10:58,510
Wanna go pack?
收拾行李去？ 好

167
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:03,280
We're doing the right thing.
我們沒做錯吧？

168
00:11:03,490 --> 00:11:04,980
Of course we are.
當然沒錯

169
00:11:05,190 --> 00:11:07,020
We left it up to fate.
我們讓命運決定

170
00:11:07,230 --> 00:11:10,860
If we were supposed to get married, there would be a sign.
如果我們應該結婚 一定會有明確的徵兆

171
00:11:18,340 --> 00:11:22,710
Okay,you have 19 questions left. Use them wisely.
好，你還剩十九個問題 要好好把握

172
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:30,850
Come on,Joey. You can't win if you don't ask any questions!
快點，你不問就…不能贏了！

173
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:35,520
-What? -You promised me a fun road trip.
怎樣啦 你說會很好玩

174
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:39,490
We've been on the road for 6 hours, and you've been asleep for 5 and a half.
結果我們開了6小時 你就睡了5個小時半

175
00:11:39,690 --> 00:11:42,930
We are switching, and you are going to drive back.
下一個休息站就換手 你給我一路開回去

176
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:47,000
That will be your punishment, you greedy sleeper!
這是對你的懲罰，貪睡鬼

177
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:49,030
All right.
好啦

178
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:52,100
And until then,you are going to sing to me...
現在你得唱歌給我聽

179
00:11:52,340 --> 00:11:56,740
...because the radio's broken and you are selfish, but you have a nice voice.
因為收音機壞了，你又很自私 但歌聲很好聽

180
00:11:57,780 --> 00:11:58,870
-Really? -Sing!
是喔？我不… 快唱

181
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:04,210
I wanna rock 'n' roll all night
我想徹夜搖滾

183
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:14,020
Man,this is a long drive.
真是開也開不完

184
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,130
Are my eyes open?
我的眼睛有睜開嗎？

185
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,630
No!
沒有！

186
00:12:34,650 --> 00:12:36,170
Morning.
早安

187
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,950
-Hey. -Hey,hubby.
老公

188
00:12:48,830 --> 00:12:53,100
Actually,I wanted to talk to you about that whole annulment thing.
我想找你討論註銷婚姻的事

189
00:12:53,300 --> 00:12:55,330
Yeah,I'm not gonna do that.
我不打算去辦

190
00:13:05,350 --> 00:13:06,810
Okay.
好

191
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:10,380
So we'll just stay married.
那我們就維持婚姻關係

192
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:11,850
Yes,exactly.
沒錯 

193
00:13:12,050 --> 00:13:15,890
And I will make everyone call me Mrs. Geller.
我會請大家叫我蓋勒太太

194
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:19,050
Wow,this is so amazing.
真是太棒了 

195
00:13:19,260 --> 00:13:23,200
I really thought I'd have to talk you into this more.
我還以為得加把勁說服你

196
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:28,070
Now I'm scared because I don't actually think you're kidding.
我現在怕了 因為你好像不是在說笑

197
00:13:29,570 --> 00:13:31,330
I'm not kidding.
我不是啊

198
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:33,010
Look...

199
00:13:33,210 --> 00:13:36,440
...I can't have three failed marriages.
我不能有三次失敗的婚姻

200
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:38,200
I can't,okay?
我不能，好嗎？

201
00:13:38,450 --> 00:13:41,610
I am not gonna be that guy.
我不要當那個人

202
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:45,820
Okay? No,no. That is not gonna be "my thing."
我不要有這個正字標記

203
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:50,420
So,what,we just stay married forever?
所以我們要永遠這樣下去？ 

204
00:13:50,590 --> 00:13:52,350
I don't know.
我不知道

205
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:55,920
I mean,I haven't worked it all out yet,but....
我還沒想清楚 

206
00:13:56,100 --> 00:14:00,260
Okay,I know it's a bit crazy..
我知道這樣有點誇張

207
00:14:00,430 --> 00:14:03,430
How is this going to affect you, really?
說真的，你有什麼影響？

208
00:14:06,170 --> 00:14:09,370
I mean,you fill some form out once in a while...
偶爾填表格要打勾時 

209
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:13,740
instead of checking the box "Miss," you check the box that says,"Mrs."
你就勾「已婚」那一格

210
00:14:13,950 --> 00:14:16,880
It's right next to it.
就在「未婚」旁邊

211
00:14:18,950 --> 00:14:21,680
Okay. I'm sorry, you're right. You know what?
好，抱歉，你說得對 

212
00:14:21,890 --> 00:14:23,620
We can stay married...
我們確實可以維持現狀

213
00:14:23,890 --> 00:14:28,420
because I thought that the boxes were far away from each other.
我還以為那兩格離得很遠

214
00:14:29,630 --> 00:14:32,000
-No, they're right.. -Ross!
不是… 羅斯！

215
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:35,430
All right. Just...

216
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:37,600
please take a moment here...
請你靜下來 

217
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:40,710
and think about what you're asking of me. Okay?
想一想你在叫我做什麼

218
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:46,000
I am asking you to do me a favor.
我在請你幫我一個忙

219
00:14:48,180 --> 00:14:51,980
You are asking me to be your wife.
你是要我當你的老婆

220
00:14:52,190 --> 00:14:57,120
And as my wife,I think you should grant me this favor.
而身為我的老婆 你應該幫我這個忙

221
00:15:00,060 --> 00:15:02,760
We did make vows.
我們發過誓了

222
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,930
That kid kicked me really hard.
那個小孩踢得好用力 

223
00:15:08,170 --> 00:15:10,140
Well,you did pull his hair.
是你扯他的頭髮

224
00:15:10,770 --> 00:15:13,670
-He took my snack. -I'm not getting into this again.
他拿我的零食 我不想再爭了

225
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:16,470
All right,you know what? Hurts really bad.
好啦 說真的，真的很痛

227
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:18,740
Well,I told you not to walk. Here.
我就叫你不要走路，來

228
00:15:18,950 --> 00:15:20,410
There. There. Okay.
來 來

229
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:32,480
-This doesn't mean anything,does it? -No.
這沒有任何含意吧？ 沒有

231
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:38,490
How could you pick up a hitchhiker?
你怎麼可以讓人搭便車？

232
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:43,330
He could be a rap.. He could be a rapist or a killer or something.
他搞不好是強… 強暴犯或殺人犯什麼的

233
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:46,270
Don't you think I asked him that before he got in?
你以為我沒有先問過嗎？

234
00:15:46,970 --> 00:15:49,770
I'm not talking to you. You go back to sleep.
我不理你了，你睡你的覺

235
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:52,450
-And,you,are you a rapist? -No.
你，你是強暴犯嗎？ 不是

236
00:15:52,650 --> 00:15:54,340
Do you like car games?
你喜歡車上遊戲嗎？

237
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:56,810
Yeah, you know the license plate game?
喜歡，你會牌照遊戲嗎？

238
00:15:57,020 --> 00:15:58,710
I love the license plate game!
我最喜歡牌照遊戲了

239
00:15:59,450 --> 00:16:00,850
I'll play. I'll play.
我也要玩，我也要玩

240
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:03,110
No, you need your sleep. Night-night.
不行，你需要睡眠，晚安

241
00:16:11,170 --> 00:16:13,630
Listen. I know you wanted to talk to me...
聽著，我知道你想找我談

242
00:16:13,830 --> 00:16:17,400
but I have an idea that may make you wanna stay married.
但我有個辦法 或許能讓你願意維持現狀

243
00:16:19,310 --> 00:16:20,970
We register...
我們去註冊

244
00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:23,910
and you get to keep all the presents.
禮物都給你

245
00:16:28,150 --> 00:16:30,670
No, Ross, come on. No,listen.
不行！羅斯，你聽我說

246
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,180
I've thought about how to tell you this.
我一直在想要怎麼表達

247
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:36,150
I came up with an analogy about a little goldfish...
結果想到一個池塘裡的金魚 

248
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:38,120
in a pond that freezes over in the winter...
在冬天凍死的比喻

249
00:16:38,290 --> 00:16:41,630
but I realized that was a story about what to do when people pick on you.
後來又想到它是在談 如何面對別人的挑剔

250
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:45,130
So I'm gonna actually save that for my children's book.
那個故事我打算寫童話書時用

251
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:47,790
-What's up? -Oh,sorry.
怎樣？ 抱歉

253
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:49,460
The bottom line,Ross...
總之...

254
00:16:49,670 --> 00:16:52,400
is we cannot stay married.
我們不能維持婚姻關係

255
00:16:53,810 --> 00:16:56,740
-I don't know if that's true.. -Oh,but it is.
那可不一定 當然一定

256
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:59,810
Okay. You know what this is?
你知道嗎？

257
00:17:00,010 --> 00:17:03,510
This is a difference of opinion.
這就叫做意見不合

258
00:17:05,850 --> 00:17:08,720
-When that happens in a marriage.. -Ross,come on!
在婚姻中遇到這種狀況… 羅斯

259
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:12,550
This is not a marriage! This is the world's worst hangover!
這不是婚姻 這是全世界最慘的宿醉

260
00:17:13,890 --> 00:17:17,020
Ross,listen, if you do not get this annulment, I will.
如果你不去註銷，我也會去

261
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:22,870
All right. All right,I'll do it.
好，我去就是了 

262
00:17:23,070 --> 00:17:24,440
Thank you.
謝謝

263
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:27,070
Hey,hey...

264
00:17:28,110 --> 00:17:31,410
is there any such thing as an annulment shower?
對了 有沒有註銷婚姻送禮會？

265
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:38,080
There's the train station. This is where I get off.
等等，火車站在那裡 我該下車了

266
00:17:38,290 --> 00:17:40,580
I have your address and phone number.
我有你的住址和電話號碼

267
00:17:40,790 --> 00:17:43,850
I have your name and the fact that you're a drifter.
我知道你的名字和你居無定所

268
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:46,890
So ball's pretty much in your court.
主動權在你手上

269
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:49,560
All right. See you,Phoebe.
好，再見

270
00:17:58,210 --> 00:18:00,730
Come on,Phoebe,I can't take this anymore.
拜託啦，我受不了了 

271
00:18:00,940 --> 00:18:02,270
Please talk to me.
求求你跟我說話

272
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:06,610
Let me make it up to you.
讓我補償你

273
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:12,080
Ground control to Major Tom
地面控制中心呼叫湯姆少校

274
00:18:13,590 --> 00:18:17,320
Commencing countdown Engines on
倒數開始，發動引擎

275
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:21,820
Take your protein pills
吞幾顆蛋白質丸 

276
00:18:22,130 --> 00:18:25,960
And put your helmet on
戴上頭盔

277
00:18:26,930 --> 00:18:29,840
-This is.. -Stop it! Stop it! No!
閉嘴，夠了

278
00:18:31,410 --> 00:18:35,240
That's not fair. You know I can't resist that beautiful voice.
不公平，你明知我無法抗拒 那美妙的歌聲

279
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:38,570
Phoebe, look, I am so sorry.
菲比，我真的很抱歉

280
00:18:38,810 --> 00:18:41,510
I promised you a fun road trip with your friend...
我答應讓你旅途愉快

281
00:18:41,780 --> 00:18:44,440
and I didn't deliver,okay?
卻沒做到

282
00:18:44,650 --> 00:18:49,610
Now I know that you think being awake is an important part of friendship.
現在我知道你認為保持清醒 對友情很重要

283
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:54,660
So I will strive to stay awake for as long as I know you.
以後我會永遠努力保持清醒

284
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:59,860
You can still sleep at night and stuff.
你晚上還是可以睡覺什麼的 

285
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:02,360
Thank you.
謝謝

286
00:19:03,100 --> 00:19:05,440
So can we play 20 Questions now?
那可以玩二十個問題了嗎？ 

287
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:08,470
I got a good one. I thought about it since Kansas.
我在堪薩斯就想到一題很棒的

288
00:19:09,710 --> 00:19:11,300
Okay.
好吧

289
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:13,770
Is it...
是...

290
00:19:13,980 --> 00:19:16,380
a kind of hot sandwich?
一種熱食三明治嗎？

291
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:18,450
Yes.
對

292
00:19:19,450 --> 00:19:21,050
Is it a meatball sub?
是肉丸潛水艇嗎？

293
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:23,220
That is incredible!
真不可思議！

294
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:25,660
You are the master!
你是大師

295
00:19:28,330 --> 00:19:29,730
Bug!

296
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:42,170
-Enough already! -Well, you didn't have to catch them!
真是夠了 誰叫你要接

297
00:19:43,210 --> 00:19:45,470
-You look like you're.. -Don't say it!
真好玩，你看起來就像要… 別說了

298
00:19:45,710 --> 00:19:47,370
Don't even think it.
想都別想

299
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:49,880
All right.
不說就不說 

300
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:51,710
Chandler,enjoy your handful.
錢德，你跟她耗吧

301
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:57,780
Should we just get married?
我們要不要乾脆結婚算了？ 

302
00:19:57,990 --> 00:20:00,720
All the signs are telling us to do it.
所有的徵兆都叫我們結

303
00:20:00,930 --> 00:20:02,260
I'm sick of the signs.
我不想理徵兆了

304
00:20:02,460 --> 00:20:05,160
-I'm happy the way things are. -Me too.
這樣太快了，我很滿意現狀 我也是

305
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:07,130
-I don't want change, do you? -No.
我不想改變，你想嗎？ 不想

306
00:20:07,330 --> 00:20:10,500
Then nothing changes! Everything stays the same!
好，那就不要改變 一切維持現狀

307
00:20:10,770 --> 00:20:13,740
Go unpack. It's been three days, and it drives me insane!
你快去整理行李 已經3天了，我快捉狂了

308
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:18,440
Jeez,relax,it's not like we're mar..
別激動，又不是要結…

309
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:30,850
You know,I was thinking, what if I...
要是我...

310
00:20:31,460 --> 00:20:32,930
unpack here?
在這裡整理呢？

311
00:20:33,290 --> 00:20:34,820
All your stuff would be here.
那你的東西都會在這裡

312
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:38,260
Well...

313
00:20:41,030 --> 00:20:42,870
...what if all my stuff was here?
要是我的東西都在這裡呢？

314
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:46,440
Then you'd be going back and forth all the time.
那你就得跑來跑去

315
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:48,700
Doesn't make any sense.
沒道理嘛 

316
00:20:49,110 --> 00:20:50,540
Okay.
好

317
00:20:53,110 --> 00:20:56,280
What if we live together, and you get what I'm saying?
要是我們同居呢？ 你懂我的意思吧？

318
00:20:59,620 --> 00:21:01,180
Live together?
同居？

319
00:21:02,190 --> 00:21:03,680
There've been no signs for that.
又沒有任何徵兆

320
00:21:04,390 --> 00:21:07,020
Me asking is kind of a sign.
我問你就是個徵兆

321
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:13,520
Yes! Yes! Yes!
好！ 好！

322
00:21:19,140 --> 00:21:21,470
Okay. Okay,wait. Wait,wait,wait.
好，你等等

323
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:23,540
Here's your key. Here's your key.
這是你的鑰匙

324
00:21:23,740 --> 00:21:25,370
Now go out and christen it!
你得進行啟用式

325
00:21:25,580 --> 00:21:27,010
Go out and come back in!
出去再進來

326
00:21:27,210 --> 00:21:29,740
Door hasn't been locked in five years, but okay.
這扇門5年沒鎖了，不過好

327
00:21:31,250 --> 00:21:33,310
-Ready? -Ready!
準備好了嗎？ 好了

328
00:21:34,490 --> 00:21:37,050
The key broke in the lock, and I can't get in.
有點問題，鑰匙斷了我進不去 

329
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:39,990
Wait. Oh,my God,I can't get out!
等等 我也出不去

330
00:21:40,190 --> 00:21:42,860
-This isn't a sign! -No,it's a very old key!
這不是徵兆吧 不是，是鑰匙很舊了

331
00:21:43,060 --> 00:21:45,400
-It's an old key! -Oh,my God,it's old!
鑰匙太舊了 舊得不得了

332
00:21:46,270 --> 00:21:47,490
I love you.
我愛你

333
00:21:49,370 --> 00:21:51,060
I love you.
我也愛你

334
00:21:51,710 --> 00:21:54,770
Are you hugging the door right now?
你有抱著門嗎？

335
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:01,510
No.
沒有

336
00:22:02,780 --> 00:22:04,580
Yeah, yeah, me neither.
好，我也沒有

337
00:22:08,690 --> 00:22:11,750
So did everything go all right with the annulment?
手續辦得還順利嗎？

338
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:14,930
Oh,yeah. No problems. It's all taken care of.
沒問題，都辦好了 

339
00:22:15,130 --> 00:22:16,430
Ross,thank you.
羅斯，謝謝你

340
00:22:18,230 --> 00:22:19,700
Do you wanna go see a movie?
你們要不要去看電影 

341
00:22:19,900 --> 00:22:21,700
-Yeah, why not? -Phoebe?
好啊.  菲比？ 

342
00:22:21,900 --> 00:22:23,770
No,thanks. I've already seen one.
不了，眼前就有一出

343
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:27,100
Okay,I'm gonna get my sweater.
我去穿毛衣 好

344
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:33,470
You wanna hear something weird?
想不想聽一件奇怪的事？ 

345
00:22:33,710 --> 00:22:35,050
Always.
當然

346
00:22:36,650 --> 00:22:38,810
I didn't get the annulment.
我沒去辦註銷

347
00:22:40,590 --> 00:22:41,580
What?
什麼？ 

348
00:22:41,790 --> 00:22:43,380
We're still married.
我們還是夫妻

349
00:22:44,590 --> 00:22:46,650
Don't tell Rachel. See you later.
不要告訴瑞秋，待會兒見

350
00:22:51,370 --> 00:22:54,271
獻給真的結婚的寇妮與大衛

351
00:23:00,040 --> 00:23:01,060
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

352
00:23:01,270 --> 00:23:02,740
Key is stuck in the lock.
鑰匙斷在鑰匙孔裡 

353
00:23:02,940 --> 00:23:04,500
I can fix it. Hold on.
我會修，等一下

354
00:23:06,580 --> 00:23:08,050
Watch out,watch out.
讓開

355
00:23:14,350 --> 00:23:15,550
It still doesn't work.
還是打不開 

356
00:23:15,790 --> 00:23:17,220
I'm not finished.
我還沒弄完

357
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:31,300
Nice job, Joe. You're quite the craftsman!
漂亮，喬伊 你的技術真好

358
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


359
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

